# skill: progress-bar

## Contract
A progress indicator component that displays percentage completion with an optional detail line. Supports both linear bar and circular variants.

### Props
| Name | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `value` | `number` | `0` | Progress percentage (0–100) |
| `label` | `string` | `'處理進度'` | Header label text |
| `detail` | `string` | `''` | Optional detail line below the bar |

### Circle Props
| Name | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `value` | `number` | `0` | Progress percentage (0–100) |
| `size` | `number` | `80` | SVG width/height in px |
| `stroke` | `number` | `8` | Stroke width in px |

## Dependencies
none

## Slots
none

## Boundaries
- `value` must be between 0 and 100; out-of-range values are clamped
- `size` and `stroke` must be positive numbers
- Circular progress uses `strokeLinecap="round"` for rounded line ends

## Examples

### Linear Bar
```jsx
<ProgressBar value={75} label="處理進度" detail="正在處理第 15 筆，共 20 筆" />
```

### Circular
```jsx
<ProgressCircle value={60} size={80} stroke={8} />
```

[html]
<div class="progress-container" id="progress-container">
  <div class="progress-header">
    <span class="progress-label">處理進度</span>
    <span class="progress-value" id="progress-value">75%</span>
  </div>
  <div class="progress-track">
    <div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill" style="width:75%"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="progress-detail" id="progress-detail">正在處理第 15 筆，共 20 筆</div>
</div>

[react]
const ProgressBar = ({ value = 0, label = '處理進度', detail = '' }) => {
  const clamped = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, value));
  return (
    <div className="progress-container">
      <div className="progress-header">
        <span className="progress-label">{label}</span>
        <span className="progress-value">{clamped}%</span>
      </div>
      <div className="progress-track">
        <div className="progress-fill" style={{ width: `${clamped}%` }}></div>
      </div>
      {detail && <div className="progress-detail">{detail}</div>}
    </div>
  );
};

const ProgressCircle = ({ value = 0, size = 80, stroke = 8 }) => {
  const clamped = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, value));
  const r = (size - stroke) / 2;
  const circ = 2 * Math.PI * r;
  const offset = circ - (clamped / 100) * circ;
  return (
    <svg width={size} height={size} style={{ transform: 'rotate(-90deg)' }}>
      <circle cx={size/2} cy={size/2} r={r} fill="none" stroke="#e5e7eb" strokeWidth={stroke} />
      <circle cx={size/2} cy={size/2} r={r} fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" strokeWidth={stroke}
        strokeDasharray={circ} strokeDashoffset={offset} strokeLinecap="round" />
    </svg>
  );
};

[style]
.progress-container { width: 100%; }
.progress-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.progress-label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #374151; }
.progress-value { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3b82f6; }
.progress-track {
  width: 100%;
  height: 10px;
  background: #e5e7eb;
  border-radius: 5px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #60a5fa);
  border-radius: 5px;
  transition: width 0.3s ease;
}
.progress-detail { font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 6px; }
